research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-refuter-lem-limit-is-local.prompt.md-1265-theorems of ZF. Passing through
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-refuter-lem-limit-is-local.prompt.md:1266:[[thm-sequential-criterion-for-function-limits]] instead would import the
